  "details": "Ban Duration*\n\nAs stated, we only have the option to Ban Users Permanently.\n\nWhat If you only wanna Ban them for only Days or 1week? 1Month? 3Months? 6Months or maybe 2yrs?\n\nMute Duration*\n\nLiterally had to spam Mute certain users till to the point of just \" you know what? [Kicked] \" all because they don't want to be civilized....\n\nWhy not the ability to Mute users for say from Seconds up to 5Mins and make it Persist on the Instance so that it cant be exploited for mute evasion.\n\nCourse Having the ability to Mute someone for like 20mins is almost like kicking them out of the world anyways....which i think last for 1 hr..",
